OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny fog should soon clear,
OL,6,Fleaving hazy sunshine for much of the
OL,7,Fday. However, outbreaks of rain may
OL,8,Fdevelop and spread northwards across
OL,9,Fthe easternmost parts, becoming more
OL,10,Fpersistent through the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe cloud will continue to
OL,13,Fbuild from the south overnight,
OL,14,Fbecoming widespread and bringing
OL,15,Fpatchy light rain and drizzle. Hill
OL,16,Ffog is also possible in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
