OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy, perhaps dull in
OL,6,Fplaces, though brightening quickly
OL,7,Fwith widespread sunshine developing
OL,8,Fthrough the morning. Becoming very
OL,9,Fwarm, with an unusually warm night to
OL,10,Ffollow. Breezy during the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fwith rain on Wednesday, clearing to
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Further rain on
OL,15,FThursday, mainly east, followed by
OL,16,Fafternoon showers. Sunny spells and
OL,17,Fafternoon showers on Friday.
OL,18,FTemperatures closer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
